--
dereferenced function pointer must be .*: FAILURE
index out of range: FAILURE
--
The locals that a goroutine copies from the spawning frame used to be lost
when the spawning path ended unreachable (at the unwinding bound) before the
goroutine was executed: its argument was then unconstrained.
